      "Translated": " 完全\n隐藏\n状态图标",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "(Status icons are the icons for online statuses such as Disconnected, Viewing Cutscene, Waiting for Duty, Mentor, New Adventurer (sprout), and so on.)",
      "Context": "UpgradeGuideTab.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped",
      "Translated": "（状态图标表示离线、观看过场动画、正在等待任务、指导者、初学者等在线状态。）",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
