    {
      "Original": "Determines how to perform icon swaps for statuses set to 'Important':\r\n- 'None' does nothing\r\n- 'Swap' will swap the status icon and job icon positions\r\n- 'Replace' will move the status icon into the job item slot, leaving the status icon empty",
      "Context": "AppearanceTab.DrawDisplayConfig",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker",
      "Translated": "设置标为「重要」的状态如何切换图标：\r\n－无：不调整。\r\n－互换：交换状态与职业图标的位置。\r\n－替代：将状态图标放到职业栏位，留空原状态栏位。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
